    <briefdescription>
<para>GPTimer Global configuration. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="struct_g_p_timer_w_f_f3___config" kindref="compound">GPTimerWFF3_Config</ref> structure contains a set of pointers used to characterize the GPTimer driver implementation. An example is shown below: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>GPTimer<sp/>configuration<sp/>(used<sp/>as<sp/>GPTimer_Handle<sp/>by<sp/>driver<sp/>and<sp/>application)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">const<sp/>GPTimerWFF3_Config<sp/>GPTimerWFF3_config[]<sp/>=<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{<sp/>&amp;GPTimerWFF3Objects[0],<sp/>&amp;GPTimerWFF3HWAttrs[0]},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{<sp/>&amp;GPTimerWFF3Objects[1],<sp/>&amp;GPTimerWFF3HWAttrs[1]},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>    </detaileddescription>
